#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:3
msgid ""
"This is the historical `3728b334` baseline. Later functionality and "
"execution status are recorded separately in [SoC extensions](soc-extensions-"
"verification.md). The hashes and counts below do not qualify those later "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"这是历史 `3728b334` 基线。后续功能和执行状态在 [SoC 扩展](soc-extensions-verification.md) "
"中单独记录；下面的 hash 和计数不资格化后续变更。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:7
msgid ""
"This record covers the {download}`55-item SoC ledger <../design/soc-"
"refinement-execution.csv>`. It distinguishes implemented mechanisms from the"
" exact source and execution scope of each result. Subsequent source changes "
"do not inherit earlier results. All physical tests remain `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"本记录覆盖 {download}`55 项 SoC 台账 <../design/soc-refinement-"
"execution.csv>`，区分已实现机制与各结果的精确源码、执行范围。后续源码变更不继承此前结果；所有物理测试保持 `not_executed`。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:12
msgid "Committed software gates"
msgstr "已提交软件门禁"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:14
msgid ""
"The following commits passed ordinary staged hooks, including the unchanged-"
"index TDD gate and commit-message checks. No test filter, skipped-only "
"report or hook bypass establishes acceptance. Counts describe their "
"individual execution scopes; they must not be added together as a final-"
"platform test total."
msgstr ""
"以下提交通过普通暂存 hook，包括 index 不变的 TDD 门禁和提交消息检查。测试过滤、仅跳过报告或绕过 hook "
"都不能建立验收。计数仅描述各自执行范围，不得相加为最终平台测试总数。"

