msgid ""
"All numerical suites above completed without failures or skips. Their staged"
" source-tree identities and raw hook outputs are retained in the external "
"`nexus-soc-20261012/evidence/batch-*/` and `nexus-soc-"
"qualification-20261012/batch-*-hook-passed/` records. An earlier failed hook"
" remains a failed attempt; its output is not rewritten as a successful run."
msgstr ""
"上述数字测试集均零失败、零跳过。暂存源码 tree 身份和原始 hook 输出保留于外部 `nexus-"
"soc-20261012/evidence/batch-*/` 和 `nexus-soc-"
"qualification-20261012/batch-*-hook-passed/`。此前失败 hook 保留失败尝试，不将输出改写为成功。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:37
msgid ""
"The dependency-only commit `ae27e999f157fecd027db99bdfa99ce38582a940` "
"additionally passed 47 actual source-SDK boundary tests with zero failures "
"or skips. Source and dependency state were clean before and after execution."
" Relocated public consumers exercised Native C/C++, the existing platform "
"ARM profiles and ThreadX within their declared scopes. This run did **not** "
"qualify H743/U575 firmware. Its raw command receipts and consumer artifacts "
"are recorded in `nexus-soc-qualification-20261012/sdk-dependency-"
"boundaries-v2/`."
msgstr ""
"仅依赖变更的提交 `ae27e999f157fecd027db99bdfa99ce38582a940` 另外通过 47 个实际 Source SDK "
"边界测试，零失败、零跳过。执行前后源码和依赖均干净。搬移后的公共消费工程 在各自声明范围验证 Native C／C++、既有平台 ARM profile"
" 和 ThreadX。此执行**没有**资格化 H743／U575 固件。原始回执和产物保留于 `nexus-soc-"
"qualification-20261012/sdk-dependency-boundaries-v2/`。"

