msgid "Baseline source qualification"
msgstr "基线源码资格"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:47
msgid ""
"The implementation qualification source is "
"`3728b334b02eb2eb70bcf5d4caafbb9746837dd3`, tree "
"`48ba820e5c2d4c372bf7eb6e909c49850cc1fe76`. Subsequent documentation commits"
" describe that exact code source; they do not replace its qualification "
"identity. The {download}`portable result index <soc-refinement-"
"results.json>` records exact report hashes and archive-relative paths "
"without copying raw logs into Git."
msgstr ""
"实现资格源码为 `3728b334b02eb2eb70bcf5d4caafbb9746837dd3`，tree "
"`48ba820e5c2d4c372bf7eb6e909c49850cc1fe76`。后续文档提交描述该精确源码，不替换其资格身份。{download}`可迁移结果索引"
" <soc-refinement-results.json>` 记录报告精确摘要和归档相对路径，不把 raw logs 复制到 Git。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:54
msgid ""
"Normal hooks passed on that source. The same complete model execution binds "
"203 reviewed I/O properties to assertion anchors and current production "
"inputs; this is bounded executed evidence, not a formal or exhaustive proof."
" All five maintained ARM gates passed, covering sixteen memory/reference "
"images and 87 selected-provider images. The same code source passed all 58 "
"installed SDK boundary tests. Its 236 actual commands include expected "
"nonzero negative-path results; the test suite has zero failures, errors or "
"skips. Earlier results, including 58 SDK tests and 22 legacy contract "
"programs on `23cde7e`, are retained as source-specific history and are not "
"promoted to the new source."
msgstr ""
"该源码通过普通 hooks。相同完整模型执行将 203 个已审查 I/O property 绑定到 assertion anchor "
"和当前生产输入；这只是有界执行证据，不是形式或穷尽证明。五个维护 ARM 门禁均通过，覆盖十六个内存／参考镜像和 87 个选定 provider "
"镜像。同一源码通过全部 58 个安装 SDK 边界测试，236 条实际命令包含预期非零负路径，测试集零失败、零错误、零跳过。此前结果包括 "
"`23cde7e` 上的 58 个 SDK 测试和 22 个旧契约程序，保留为源码专属历史，不提升为新源码资格。"

