#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:79
msgid ""
"The H743 ELF gate inspects the actual reset-to-power-entry closure before "
"RAM is usable, in addition to vector bytes, selected retention and "
"resources. The U575 gate preserves the declared TZEN=0 single-state boot "
"boundary. Its vector/count checks do not automatically prove the complete "
"Reset/SystemInit/data/BSS/MSP call closure. Independent review has now "
"checked all eight actual H743/U575 images, including the complete linked "
"startup path and four-byte DATA load alignment; 2,297 identified inputs "
"stayed unchanged before and after capture. The gate's "
"`source_and_call_closure_review_required` boundary is closed by that "
"separate source-bound report, not by relabelling the vector test. Neither "
"ARM gate executes a scheduler on the MCU or establishes a measured "
"electrical result."
msgstr ""
"H743 ELF 门禁除向量字节、选定保留和资源外，还检查 RAM 可用前的实际 reset-to-power-entry 闭包。U575 门禁保留声明"
" TZEN=0 单状态启动边界，其 vector／count 检查不会自动证明完整 Reset／SystemInit／data／BSS／MSP "
"调用闭包。独立审查已检查八个实际 H743／U575 镜像，包括完整链接启动路径和 four-byte DATA load 对齐；采集前后 2,297 "
"个已识别输入未变。`source_and_call_closure_review_required` 由单独源码绑定报告关闭，不能通过重标 vector"
" 测试关闭。两个 ARM 门禁均没有在 MCU 上运行 scheduler，也不建立实测电气结果。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:90
msgid ""
"The actual selected-reference costs are below. Flash is the sum of LOAD file"
" bytes, not the largest occupied address span. RAM includes reserved MSP "
"exactly once; every row reserves 2,048 MSP bytes and zero heap. Static "
"reservations are not measured stack high water or product application "
"budgets."
msgstr ""
"实际所选参考成本如下。Flash 为 LOAD 文件字节总和，不是最大占用地址跨度。RAM 只计一次预留 MSP，每行 2,048 MSP "
"bytes、零 heap。静态预留不是实测栈峰值或产品预算。"

