"above. The actual 46-command clean execution and its source record are "
"indexed separately. The ten HIL preparations do not mean ten physical "
"station executions."
msgstr ""
"外部示例资格为代码 commit `f02b91867bb64abfa31e3c1d4b6004bd1a38b091`，pin 到上述平台源码。实际 "
