msgstr "解释台账"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:135
msgid ""
"`implemented` records a mechanism in source. `contract_implemented` and "
"`documentation_updated` record narrower contract/documentation work. "
"`qualification_record_authority` delegates acceptance to the actual external"
" record for the exact source/configuration/artifact tuple; it is not a "
"source file's self-reported pass. `final_source_pending` means that "
"execution is still required for the completed source scope."
msgstr ""
"`implemented` 记录源码中的机制。`contract_implemented` 和 `documentation_updated` "
"记录范围更窄的契约／文档工作。`qualification_record_authority` 将验收交给精确 "
"source／configuration／artifact tuple 的外部实际记录，不是源码文件自报 "
"passed。`final_source_pending` 表示完成的源码范围仍需执行。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:142
msgid ""
"`selected_profiles_observed` records actual static cost measurements only "
"for the profiles named above and in the index. `tooling_software_validated` "
"qualifies the HIL software contracts; the corresponding physical test "
"remains unexecuted. The partial-reference implementation states preserve "
"their limited GPIO/UART scope even after host, ARM or installed-SDK checks "
"pass."
msgstr ""
"`selected_profiles_observed` 只记录以上及索引命名 profile "
"的真实静态成本。`tooling_software_validated` 资格化 HIL "
"软件契约，相应物理测试仍未执行。部分参考实现即使通过主机、ARM 或安装 SDK 检查，也保留有限 GPIO／UART 范围。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:148
msgid ""
"SOC-05 records versioned datasheet, manual and errata provenance. Actual "
"silicon revision and full per-mode errata applicability remain unqualified. "
"SOC-23 and SOC-27 require observed actual ELF costs; an observer's unit "
"tests alone do not complete measurement. A changed capacity, backend, Board "
"route or memory layout must be reported as a distinct selection rather than "
"a like-for-like saving."
msgstr ""
"SOC-05 记录版本化 datasheet、manual、errata 来源，实际硅片修订及每个模式完整 errata "
"适用性仍未资格化。SOC-23／SOC-27 要求实际 ELF 成本观察，observer 单元测试不能完成测量。容量、后端、Board route "
"或内存布局变化应作为不同选择报告，不能描述为同配置节省。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:154
msgid ""
"SOC-28, SOC-30 and SOC-31 contain only the exact H743/U575 GPIO/UART/time "
"reference subset. SOC-29 and SOC-32–36 retain explicit missing features. "
"Their original exit conditions remain unchanged. A rejected unsupported mode"
" is not a completed mode implementation. SOC-37–55 contain executable "
"software preparation, admission, capture and validation tools; every "
"physical exit remains open until real station records are captured and "
"validated."
msgstr ""
"SOC-28、SOC-30、SOC-31 仅包含精确 H743／U575 GPIO／UART／time 参考子集。SOC-29、SOC-32–36 "
"保留明确缺失功能，原始退出条件不变。拒绝不支持模式不是该模式实现完成。SOC-37–55 包含可执行的软件准备、准入、采集、校验工具；真实 "
"station 记录采集并校验前，所有物理退出保持开放。"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md:161
msgid ""
"No result here establishes MCU cycles, interrupt latency, Flash power-loss "
"behavior, cache/DMA coherence, TrustZone isolation, product safety, "
"certification or a product release. Exact support remains defined by the "
"[support matrix](support.md) and [SoC contracts](../design/soc-"
"refinement.md)."
msgstr ""
"这里没有结果建立 MCU cycles、中断延迟、Flash 掉电、cache／DMA 一致性、TrustZone "
"隔离、产品安全、认证或产品发布。精确支持由[支持矩阵](support.md)及 [SoC 合同](../design/soc-"
"refinement.md)定义。"
